# DUNE EXPRESS: a broken strongbox spills four dollars, and picking them all up
# is the loot; with the objective done, reaching Biscuit ends the heist; the
# three stars.
game dune
wait 5
cheat mission 1
cheat pos 41 6
cheat face 1
press B
wait 40
hold LEFT 12
hold RIGHT 45
expect loot == 1
cheat pos 57 6
hold RIGHT 20
expect result == 1
expect state == 4
expect stars & 1
expect stars !& 2
